  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PDC C from research to policy HMU and KI - PDC C from research to policy</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PDC C fr&#xe5;n forskning till policy HMU samt KI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En akt&#xf6;rssamverkan mellan ett flertal akt&#xf6;rer: Hanoi Medical Univ, Univ. of Medicine and Pharmacy Ho Chi Minh City, Karolinska  Institutet, Sahlgrenska Akademin vid G&#xf6;teborgs Univ. samt Oxford Univ. Clinical Research Unit. M&#xe5;let med samarbetet &#xe4;r att skapa ett h&#xe5;llbart forskningsn&#xe4;tverk som, genom st&#xe4;rkandet av kapacitet och mobilisering av resurser, kan tillgodose resultatbaserade policys</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This PDC is between Hanoi Medical University,University of Medicine and Pharmacy Ho Chi Minh City,Karolinska Institutet,The Sahlgrenska Academy at University of Gothenburg,and Oxford University Clinical Research Unit.The aim of the cooperation is create a sustainable research network that provides evidence based policy recommendations by arranging capacity building for resource mobilization</narrative>
  </description>
